  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Eighty-Eight True Yang Building is named as an Immortal Gu House under Giant Sun’s will. That House is a solidified killer move formed from many Immortal Gu and mortal Gu, with its own methods against enemies, and able to activate by absorbing the yellow apricot immortal essence Giant Sun Immortal Venerable left behind.",
      "chapters": [
        607
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a rank eight Immortal Gu House formed from extremely large numbers of Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        624
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Water Pavilion is a rank seven Immortal Gu House made up of over three thousand Gu worms, each interlinked and connected to the others.",
      "chapters": [
        641
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gu-count-and-rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_water_pavilion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Gu Houses are more complete than immortal killer moves and are the symbol of super forces. Basically every super force owns one. Northern Plains Zombie Alliance’s leader seeking a House is read as an intention to elevate that branch to super force level.",
      "chapters": [
        741
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "super-force-symbol",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal killer moves can be targeted and subdued more easily, but Immortal Gu Houses combine defense and offense. Even when specialties differ, they do not fundamentally lack other aspects. The more Gu Immortals a House stores, the stronger its might, approaching an unstoppable fortress on the battlefield.",
      "chapters": [
        797
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-fortress",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_killer_move",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Any Immortal Gu House is a unified construct covering defense, attack, movement, healing, investigative work, and related aspects. Named Houses such as Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, Water Pavilion, Heaven Overseeing Tower, Red Fiend Divine Boat, and Profound Ice House all count as war fortresses in that frame.",
      "chapters": [
        837
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unified-war-fortress",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "house_red_fiend_divine_boat",
        "house_profound_ice_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Gu Houses are related to a Gu cultivation path as the utmost materialization of formation path. A refinement path Gu formation near Heaven Overseeing Tower is judged a step away from becoming a rank eight Immortal Gu House.",
      "chapters": [
        871
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-path-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Named Houses have their own pages under Gu houses. Broader Gu house dwellings are covered on Gu House. Mortal Gu Houses named as such are covered on Mortal Gu House. Gu formations as arranged structures are covered on Gu formation.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-path-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_house",
        "sys_mortal_gu_house",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    }
